00:17:17,820 --> 00:17:18,840
So you get my point.

271
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:21,840
I would reject him.

272
00:17:21,940 --> 00:17:23,300
There's nothing else I could do.

273
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:23,780
Exactly.

274
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,640
He's not my type, and I don't think I'm his.

275
00:17:26,900 --> 00:17:29,420
He would never want to go out with me, and that's A-OK.

276
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:30,600
You get it.

277
00:17:30,780 --> 00:17:31,780
Guess I already did.

278
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:33,400
Just needed confirmation.

279
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:35,960
She's right.

280
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:37,800
Friends are friends.

281
00:17:38,600 --> 00:17:39,380
I knew that.

282
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:41,160
It's Maureen!

283
00:17:41,820 --> 00:17:42,100
Oh.

284
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:43,020
Oh no.

285
00:17:43,900 --> 00:17:44,420
Kitagawa.

286
00:17:44,420 --> 00:17:44,840
Hmm?

287
00:17:45,780 --> 00:17:46,920
I think you should go.

288
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,380
Huh?

289
00:17:48,980 --> 00:17:50,540
Oh, I didn't mean it that way.

290
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:53,080
You're frying mackerel?

291
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:54,080
I was.

292
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:56,100
I know you want fried food.

293
00:17:56,300 --> 00:17:57,860
You mentioned craving it the other night.

294
00:17:57,860 --> 00:18:04,660
I figured fried fish was healthy enough, but apparently it's still too heavy to eat at dinner time.

295
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:10,700
I've never gone on a diet before, so I didn't know about the timing aspect.

296
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:14,080
You got here before I could call you and explain my mistake.

297
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:16,340
Why can't I just spit it out?

298
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:17,220
Sorry.

299
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:23,760
You came all the way here, and now you have nothing to eat.

300
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:25,100
I have this.

301
00:18:25,940 --> 00:18:27,080
It looks great.

302
00:18:28,220 --> 00:18:29,680
Uh, are you sure?

303
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:31,560
I can call today my cheat day.

304
00:18:31,900 --> 00:18:32,680
Cheat day?

305
00:18:33,140 --> 00:18:34,860
Would you like me to remove the breading?

306
00:18:35,060 --> 00:18:36,820
I'm planning to grill Grandpa's fish.

307
00:18:37,220 --> 00:18:37,640
Uh-uh.

308
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:40,900
I want it like this.

309
00:18:45,900 --> 00:18:51,320
The crunchy breading and the fluffy fish are like soulmates!

310
00:18:51,320 --> 00:18:55,260
That's good, but eat your vegetables, too!

311
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,700
What are these killer flavors?

312
00:18:59,020 --> 00:19:01,980
It's plum and shiso, so it doesn't need any sauce.

313
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:02,840
It's healthier.

314
00:19:03,360 --> 00:19:05,500
You're becoming quite the chef, Wakuna.

315
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:06,980
You think so?

316
00:19:07,340 --> 00:19:07,940
Certainly.

317
00:19:09,300 --> 00:19:11,580
Oh yeah, yours has grated daikon in it, Grandpa.

318
00:19:12,320 --> 00:19:13,580
Nutritious and delicious.

319
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:19,100
After watching Maureen eat hers, my stomach's telling me to taste-test the fried version.

320
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:20,160
Then you can have half.

321
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:21,440
Don't be stingy.

322
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:25,580
I couldn't prepare very much, so no leftovers tonight.

323
00:19:25,820 --> 00:19:26,400
I'm sorry.

324
00:19:29,580 --> 00:19:31,160
Well then...

325
00:19:31,160 --> 00:19:36,440
Hey, Gojo.

326
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:39,220
Walk with me?

327
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:40,820
Just tonight?

328
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:43,300
Yeah, I don't mind.

329
00:19:44,240 --> 00:19:44,880
Wait for me here.

330
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:45,800
I'll go grab a coat.

331
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:47,580
Uh-huh.

332
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:58,840
It's been getting dark so early lately.

333
00:19:59,540 --> 00:20:00,080
Yeah.

334
00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:03,720
I forgot to mention.

335
00:20:04,500 --> 00:20:05,400
Murakami told me...

336
00:20:08,100 --> 00:20:09,320
Kitagawa?

337
00:20:09,320 --> 00:20:15,740
Hey, while we're here, there's something I'd like to tell you.

338
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:19,320
I, uh...

339
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:30,700
Can I come over again tomorrow?

340
00:20:30,700 --> 00:20:34,380
Of course.

341
00:20:34,580 --> 00:20:35,280
I'd like that.

342
00:20:43,020 --> 00:20:44,860
I'll give you some money for the food.

343
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:46,040
Huh?

344
00:20:46,320 --> 00:20:47,380
You don't need to.

345
00:20:47,740 --> 00:20:50,180
You pay me way too generously for making your outfits.

346
00:20:50,180 --> 00:21:06,260
I want it to be honest, but I couldn't even look him in the eye.

347
00:21:07,840 --> 00:21:10,400
Until recently, I've been going with the flow.

348
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:14,300
I told myself, if it doesn't work out, it doesn't work out.

349
00:21:14,760 --> 00:21:16,520
I'm a big girl and I'll be fine.

350
00:21:22,680 --> 00:21:25,640
If it doesn't work out now, I'll be crushed.

351
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:28,640
Has it always been like this?

352
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:36,880
I'm so gross when I'm depressed.

353
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:40,460
What's a cute girl like you doing out so late by herself?

354
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,140
If you're bored, we could...

355
00:21:42,140 --> 00:21:42,920
Die in a hole.

356
00:21:45,160 --> 00:21:46,660
I'm being such a weenie.

357
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:49,340
I need to pull my head out of my butt and be myself.

358
00:21:49,340 --> 00:21:52,220
I'm mentally exhausted right now.

359
00:21:52,540 --> 00:21:54,420
And we have our group cosplay this week.

360
00:21:55,700 --> 00:21:56,320
That's it.

361
00:21:56,540 --> 00:21:59,420
After we wrap up the coffin cosplay, I'm gonna tell him.

362
00:21:59,640 --> 00:22:00,540
I have no choice.

363
00:22:00,760 --> 00:22:01,560
I have to.

364
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:04,080
I have to tell Gojo that I love him.

365
00:22:04,080 --> 00:22:34,060
We'll be right back.

366
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:36,700
I know.

367
00:22:36,700 --> 00:22:39,440
I have to tell you.

368
00:22:39,660 --> 00:22:41,240
What a spirit.

369
00:22:41,420 --> 00:22:43,280
Is it not?

370
00:22:43,380 --> 00:22:46,700
interventions in the late.

371
00:22:49,100 --> 00:22:53,740
Is it enough to me?

372
00:22:58,140 --> 00:23:02,200
How about club Acho?

373
00:23:02,200 --> 00:23:04,420
New, new, new

374
00:23:04,420 --> 00:23:06,740
可愛い会話

375
00:23:06,740 --> 00:23:09,300
トキメキ感じて

376
00:23:09,300 --> 00:23:11,900
君からの変身まで

377
00:23:11,900 --> 00:23:14,140
可愛い会話

378
00:23:14,140 --> 00:23:16,820
胸も高鳴る

379
00:23:16,820 --> 00:23:18,460
雨変わるよ

380
00:23:18,460 --> 00:23:20,580
君と変わるよ

381
00:23:20,580 --> 00:23:25,240
可愛い会話

382
00:23:25,240 --> 00:23:36,440
次回予告

